units real
atom_style full
bond_style harmonic
angle_style charmm
pair_style hybrid lj/cut/tip4p/long/opt 1 2 1 1 0.1546 14.0 9.0 lj/cut/soft 2.0 0.5 14.0
kspace_style pppm/tip4p 1.0e-4
read_data h2o_equil.data nocoeff
pair_modify tail yes mix arithmetic
pair_coeff 1 1 lj/cut/tip4p/long/opt 0.185207 3.1589 14.0
pair_coeff 1 2 lj/cut/tip4p/long/opt 0.0 3.1589 9.0
pair_coeff 2 2 lj/cut/tip4p/long/opt 0.0 3.1589 9.0
pair_coeff 1 3 lj/cut/soft 0.2333487979600495 3.44445 1.0
pair_coeff 2 3 lj/cut/soft 0.0 3.44445 1.0
pair_coeff 3 3 lj/cut/soft 0.0 3.73 1.0
bond_coeff 1 103.39 0.9572
angle_coeff 1 0 104.52 0 0
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes one 10000 page 100000
group H2O type 1 2
fix myshk H2O shake 1.0e-5 200 0 b 1 a 1
fix integ all nvt temp 300 300 100
timestep 2.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe press density
run 1000
